<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Sangini
  – A system that remembers</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Lora:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#f7f4ee;
    --ink:#1f2a22;
    --muted:#4f5a52;
    --green:#2f6b3f;
    --green-dark:#265734;
    --gold:#a88a5a;
    --line:#cfd8cf;
    --serif:'Lora',Georgia,serif;
    --sans:'Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{font-family:var(--sans);color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg)}

    .hero{
    position:relative;min-height:100vh;overflow:hidden;
       background:
      url("images/hero.jpg") center right / cover no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(120deg,#e9efe0,#a9c58f 60%,#6f9a55);
  }
  /* 2) The fade: solid cream on the left so text is readable,
        transparent on the right so faces stay visible. */
  .hero::before{
    content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg,var(--bg) 0%,rgba(247,244,238,.85) 30%,rgba(247,244,238,.35) 60%,transparent 85%),
      linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 80%,var(--bg) 100%);
  }
  .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:1380px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,6vw,80px)}


  nav{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    padding:20px 0}
  .brand{display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:12px;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:18px;
    color:var(--ink);
    text-decoration:none}

  .logo{width:50px;
    height:40px;
    background:#fff;
    border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:20px}
  .links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:34px}
  .links a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:16px}
  .links a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
  .links .cta{
    background:var(--green);color:#fff;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600
  }
  .links .cta:hover{background:var(--green-dark);color:#fff}

  .content{padding:clamp(60px,11vh,130px) 0 60px;max-width:830px}
  .eyebrow{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;
    font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green)
  }
  .eyebrow i{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green)}
  h1{
    font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;
    font-size:clamp(44px,7vw,84px);line-height:1.12;margin:34px 0 36px;letter-spacing:-.01em
  }
  h1 em{
    font-style:normal;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,#b0956a,#7d8f55);
    -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;
  }
  .lede{font-size:clamp(18px,1.6vw,24px);line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);max-width:740px}
  .lede strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}

  .buttons{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px;margin-top:40px}
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:19px 34px;border-radius:10px;
    font:600 18px var(--sans);text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid transparent;
    transition:background .2s,transform .2s
  }
  .btn.primary{background:var(--green);color:#fff}
  .btn.primary:hover{background:var(--green-dark);transform:translateY(-1px)}
  .btn.ghost{background:rgba(255,255,255,.6);color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--line);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
  .btn.ghost:hover{background:#fff}
  .btn svg{width:12px;height:12px;fill:currentColor}

  .pills{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;margin-top:44px}
  .pill{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 18px;font-size:15px;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.7);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;backdrop-filter:blur(6px)
  }
  .pill i{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold)}
  .pill.green i{background:var(--green)}

  .scroll{
    position:absolute;z-index:1;left:50%;bottom:28px;transform:translateX(-50%);
    text-align:center;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none
  }
  .scroll svg{display:block;margin:8px auto 0;width:20px;animation:bob 2s ease-in-out infinite}
  @keyframes bob{50%{transform:translateY(5px)}}

 
  @media(max-width:860px){
    .links a:not(.cta){display:none}
    .hero::before{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(247,244,238,.92) 0%,rgba(247,244,238,.8) 60%,var(--bg) 100%)}
  }
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.scroll svg{animation:none}html{scroll-behavior:auto}}
  :focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:3px}

  
  #demo{padding:120px 0;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav>
      <a class="brand" href="#"><span class="logo" aria-hidden="true">✒️</span>Sangini</a>
      <div class="links">
        <a href="#demo">Demo</a>
        <a href="#problem">Problem</a>
        <a href="#approach">Approach</a>
        <a href="#product">Product</a>
        <a href="#team">Team</a>
        <a href="#vision">Vision</a>
        <a class="cta" href="#partner">Partner with us</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="content">
      <p class="eyebrow"><i></i>Field health system · Nepal &amp; India</p>
      <h1>A system that <em>remembers</em>,<br>so health workers don't have to.</h1>
      <p class="lede"><strong>Sangini</strong> helps FCHVs record patient visits, track pregnancies, manage vaccination schedules, and access maternal health protocols through simple voice conversations, even without internet access.</p>

      <div class="buttons">
        <a class="btn primary" href="#demo"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M1 0l11 6-11 6z"/></svg>Watch the working prototype</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="#partner">Partner with us</a>
      </div>

      <div class="pills">
        <span class="pill"><i></i>Presented at TMSoN 2026, National Telemedicine &amp; Digital Health Conference</span>
        <span class="pill green"><i></i>Built for Nepal's 52,000+ FCHVs</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <a class="scroll" href="#demo">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 20 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M1 1l9 8 9-8"/></svg>
  </a>
</header>

<section id="demo"><div class="wrap"><p>Next section goes here.</p></div></section>

</body>
</html>
